## Validation and correction record

- Initial `exec:java` invocation reused stale Java class files. It generated a
  fixture without the new inventory keys, and the Protocol inventory test
  failed (`Null` versus empty array). Diagnosis: the Java source had not been
  compiled before execution. No implementation test failure remained after
  regeneration with `mvn -o -q -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml compile
  exec:java -Dexec.args='runtime-lookup-fixtures <absolute lookup.json path>'`.
- PASS: all-feature locked/offline tests for Protocol, Consumer, Remoting, and
  Core. Protocol passed 143 unit tests and 73 doctests, including both new
  compile-fail checks.
- PASS: strict all-target/all-feature Clippy for all four crates with
  `-D warnings`.
- PASS: pinned offline Maven `verify`; all 37 scenarios, fixture checks, 66
  typed-header cross-decodes, and 15 typed-body cross-decodes.
- PASS: `cargo fmt --all -- --check` and `git diff --check`.
- This slice does not close broad P18-V01 or the final workspace P18-V02 gate.
